B.aNB=new A.r("love","I have a heart that never beats yet lovers chase me across centuries. What am I?","A love letter")
B.aRj=new A.r("love","Two share me but neither owns me alone; without trust I vanish. What am I?","A secret")
B.aVO=new A.r("love","Deep riddle #3 \u2014 I grow when given away in romance yet shrink when hoarded in silence. What am I?","Affection")
B.b0c=new A.r("love","I bind no rope yet hold two souls tighter than chains. What am I?","A vow")
B.aYD=new A.r("love","Challenge 5: Seen in eyes before spoken on lips; I arrive first at every true meeting. What am I?","Recognition")
B.aUi=new A.r("bible","Deep riddle #6 \u2014 I swallowed a man yet could not digest his prayer; I returned him on the third dawn. What am I?","The great fish")
B.aXu=new A.r("bible","Built with pitch and gopher wood, I rode forty days of rain. What am I? (Think carefully.)","Noah's ark")
B.aNC=new A.r("bible","I parted for a nation fleeing; walls of me stood like guards then fell flat. What am I?","The Red Sea")
B.aYo=new A.r("bible","Deep riddle #9 \u2014 Small in hand, giant on the field; one smooth stone ended my echo. What am I?","Goliath's challenge")
B.aPl=new A.r("bible","Challenge 10: I burned yet was not consumed; a bush spoke from within me. What am I?","The burning bush")
B.aZX=new A.r("street","I speak without a mouth on every corner; ignore me and pay a fine. What am I?","A traffic sign")
B.aNp=new A.r("street","Deep riddle #12 \u2014 I change color but never mood; red stops, green releases. What am I?","A stoplight")
B.aVF=new A.r("street","Rolling on four yet carrying hundreds; I stop every block but never walk. What am I?","A city bus")
B.aWF=new A.r("street","I am tagged in spray paint yet tell stories the city tries to erase. What am I? (Think carefully.)","Graffiti")
B.aS6=new A.r("street","Challenge 15: Sold from a window with no door; hunger knows my bell. What am I?","A food truck")
